  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c302ff5f125211d4b88dc2bb42bf0fa8, type: 3}
  m_Name: LearnedPilot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DeepWater.Aviator::DeepWater.Aviator.ScriptableObjects.LearnedPilotSO
  eyesAndHands: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d331f8342967b6a4c83507d3b7fd292e, type: 2}
  decisionPeriodTicks: 5
  maxLifeS: 180
  turnRangeDeg: 180
  climbRangeM: 1500
  minKt: 150
  maxKt: 600
  minG: 2
  provenance: "AUTHORED 2026-10-29 from SIX's picks in the training interview (TRAINING-CONCEPT
    M21\u2013M28; all eight recommended options). Eyes and hands (M23, M17): the
    ace's profile (150\xB0 field of view, 0.35 s late, 10 km, 12 s memory; 7 G, 75\xB0
    bank), so a learned pilot wins by judgement, not a better airframe or better
    eyes. decisionPeriodTicks 5: ten decisions a second, the rule pilots' trigger
    rate (A12). maxLifeS 180: a life longer than three minutes is cut (interrupted,
    not lost). Actions (M1, M23): turnRangeDeg 180 (any heading), climbRangeM 1500,
    minKt 150 and maxKt 600 (the jet's fighting range, below its 7.5 G corner and
    above its stall), minG 2."
